Breakfast Show. Heart Radio, CBeebies, Santa Radio and ITV - Guy Harris - Official Father Christmas\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Voice of Santa - Guy Harris"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>As heard on BBC Radio 2 and Zoe Ball's Breakfast Show. Heart Radio, CBeebies, Santa Radio, ITV, Boom Radio, Capital X-tra and <a href=\"/santa-voice\" title=\"Santa Claus for Hire\">many more</a>!</p>\r\n"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/alton-towers-scarefest-spooky-voice","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Spooky Voice - Alton Towers Scarefest","aria-label":"Previous: Spooky Voice - Alton Towers Scarefest","children":"‹"}],["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/13-dead-end-drive-voiceover","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"13 Dead End Drive Voiceover","aria-label":"Next: 13 Dead End Drive Voiceover","children":"›"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2><b>The UK's Official Father Christmas Voice</b></h2>\r\n<p>December can't come soon enough. This really is my favourite voice!<br>From September onwards the demand for Santa comes in and from Radio Commercials to Radio Station imaging, Event Voice of God, Personal Santa messages, the Voice of Santa for ITV, BBC Radio 2, HEART, even Santa on <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yi-4Fm40nmE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Santa on CBeebies Go Jetters\">CBeebies Go Jetters</a> and not forgetting Santa's very own Radio station Santa Radio.<br>\r\nRamming Christmas down your chimney!\r\n</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/P44bGiUI0vE","title":"Voice of Santa - Guy Harris","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/voice-of-santa-guy-harris.jpg","alt":"voice-of-santa","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"Voice of Santa - Guy Harris"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2><b>The Voice of Santa for ITV BBC Radio 2 and Heart</b></h2>\r\n<p>Along with countless other brands across the UK, I'm extremely proud to be the Voice of Santa. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qqu-HDA2KJE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Santa Chatting with Zoe Ball on BBC Radio 2\">Chatting with Zoe Ball</a> just days before Christmas on air and talking with the kids is a personal highlight. Advertising Daytimes on ITV as Santa and adding to the fun on Heart Xmas really is as exciting as Christmas itself.<br>\r\nFor me the No.1 Voice of Santa is Richard Attenborough from Miracle on 34th Street but I'm happy to take 2nd place to him. 🎅</p>"}}]]}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2><b>Have you heard Santa Radio?</b></h2>\r\n<p>To keep the Elves motivated, Santa set up his very own radio station. In the Air and On the Air, <a href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Official site of Santa Radio\">Santa Radio</a> broadcasts from the North Pole 365 days a year. The Host? Well, thats Santa himself.<br>\r\nAlongside a sackful of Christmas music, listen out for Santa's Little Helpers! Download the <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/santa-radio/id1021183593\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Christmas Radio and Santa Radio App\">Christmas Radio App</a>, send Santa a message and may hear yourself on air. On the <a href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk/mugshots/all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Santa Radio MugShots\">MugShots</a> page, Ecurb the Elf thrust the Santa Radio Mug into the hands of over 450 Celebrities!<Do have a listen to the Best Christmas Radio Station online. Santa Radio!\r\n</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/voice-of-santa-guy-harris-santa_radio.jpg","alt":"voice-of-santa","className":"blog-post-img"}]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/free-personalised-santa-messages.jpg","alt":"voice-of-santa","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2><b>Free Personalised Santa Messages</b></h2>\r\n<p>Fancy a message from Santa?<br>\r\nGrab a free one over on the Santa Radio Website. <br>Father Christmas has kindly offered to record a short <a href=\"https://festivestudio.com/store/santa-radio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"FREE personal message from Santa\">FREE personal Santa message</a> for your little one.<br>\r\nSimply type in your name and hit Generate. Name not listed? <br>Top Tip. Does it sound like another name? Type a similar sounding name instead. Then simply hit download!\r\n</p>"}}]]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; color: #AD030C;\">Where Can I Get a Genuine Voice of Santa?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\nOthers may imitate, but if you want a fun, cheeky, and lovable Santa voice, you’ve come to the right place!<br>\r\nSimply <a href=\"mailto:santa@voiceoverguy.co.uk\" style=\"color: #0073e6;\">email Santa</a> with your project details, including the script length and how it will be used, and the Head Elf will work out a price for you.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\nI look forward to working with you, or should I say, Santa looks forward to it. Accept no substitutes!\r\n</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Voice of Santa - Guy Harris","pageUrl":"voice-of-santa-guy-harris"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","957",{"href":"/yorkshire-podcast-studio","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/west-yorkshire-studio-march25.jpg","alt":"yorkshire-podcast-studio","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Yorkshire Podcast Studio "}]]}],["$","$L3","621",{"href":"/air-malta-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/air-malta-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Air Malta Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Air Malta Voiceover"}]]}],["$","$L3","838",{"href":"/little-monster-media-movie-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related